cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Euro Stablecoin Exposure Monitor"
abstract: >-
  A web application that estimates how many dollar stablecoins (USDT, USDC) euro area
  residents hold and shows what each level of adoption would mean for bank deposits,
  wholesale funding and credit, country by country and bank by bank, with a weekly
  monitor of stablecoin trading against the euro. Independent university project
  (ESCP Business School).
authors:
